# Media assets (~298MB of images/audio/video) — kept OUT of the repo.
# These are a managed payload: restore them into public/ from the asset
# archive (the sitesucker backup) before running `npm run build` / deploying.
# NOTE: with these ignored, a fresh clone alone cannot produce a working
# build until the assets are copied back in.
/public/panels/
/public/pops/
/public/images/

